@startuml
!theme plain
title Closed-Loop Back-to-Car - Safety-Gated IVI Coaching

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #19226D

start
:Fleet risk event generated;\nlabel + severity + confidence + evidence;
:Check intervention eligibility;

if (Real-time event?) then (yes)
  if (confidence high\nand latency < budget?) then (yes)
    if (driver annoyance risk low\nand fallback available?) then (yes)
      :Send IVI advisory;\nvisual / voice / haptic;
      :Log intervention outcome;
    else (no)
      :Do not alert in-car;\nstore for post-trip coaching;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Fleet dashboard alert only;
  endif
else (post-trip)
  :Generate coaching report;\n3 actions for next trip;
endif

:Fleet Manager sees event,\nintervention, and result;
stop

note right
Examples:
- TTC critical -> slow down advisory
- distracted at speed -> attention reminder
- repeated lane drift -> coaching card
- harsh brake near rear vehicle -> post-trip review
end note

@enduml
